From: SteveDeFacto <5148995+SteveDeFacto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:27:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Test the dropped-wallet receipt check on both routes, and the
 wallet route in the built site

site-wallet-receipt-drop: the real sendTx/waitReceipt on loopback origins in front of
anvil --no-mining, with only waitReceipt's 2-s pause shortened: a wallet that never
relayed is still refused after 20 polls; a wallet holding it pending keeps waiting;
a profile-sent transaction (accepted, or unknown and lost) never consults the wallet
and nothing is resent. site-built-wallet-route: the scripts/build-site.mjs output in
Chromium, the popover choice and the built chunks' own sendTx/waitReceipt, with a lost
profile-sent transaction polled on the real clock past the drop check. The rig gains a
siteDir option and a swallow-raw origin mode.
